WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.400
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.680
Please no! Stop it!

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.950
Please don't!

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:30.760
Why do you hurt him?

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.150
Why? Why?

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.360
Why?

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.070
Don't you guys even realize
that what you're doing is wrong?

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:46.880
- I-I won't ever do it again.
- Who the hell...!

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.040
Who the hell's gonna believe that?

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.280
I try this hard to get my point across.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.510
Yet you guys continue to betray me!

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.720
You immediately betray me!

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:00.780
WHY?

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:06.330
Why can't you guys do the right thing?

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:11.230
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:18.740
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.750
Although loneliness...

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:27.080
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.320
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:39.400
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:42.360
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:49.900
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:53.680
...the dream and the reality...

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:57.310
...that you saw cross paths

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:01.010
Some light is shed...

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:05.590
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:12.820
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:20.830
The things I want have no shape

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:29.240
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:43.410
Something I Can't Let Go

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:49.760
Okay.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.730
Kouji. Wake up.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:02.470
I told you, I don't like to
be woken up like that, Ikumi.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:05.180
Morning!

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:12.540
Ah... yeah. Good morning.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.810
Come on, what are you
being so uptight about?

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:17.830
Hurry and get ready, or you'll be late.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.490
R-Right.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.060
- There's more if you want.
- This looks great.

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:25.100
Why did you bring her over here?

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:28.040
There's no other option. It's too
dangerous for her to be alone.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.340
Are you gonna cash in on the benefits
of a special status guy too?

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:31.940
It's not like that.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.170
Kouji and I have been
friends forever. That's all.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.640
Boy, that hit the spot.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.380
We're cleaning section 27 today, right?

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.310
Let's not talk about
work until we get there!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:42.550
Here.

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:43.950
Huh? Forget it.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.010
No, take it. You need the nutrition.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.050
For one thing, you're not
getting enough calcium.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.860
Look at you.
Here...

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:56.000
You're so sloppy.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.000
- Okay, I'm sorry.
- There. Okay.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:03.760
See you later!

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:11.940
<i>I can't do anything. Not for Kozue.</i>
<i>Not for Reiko. Not for Ikumi!</i>

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:13.780
<i>And!</i>

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:22.920
<i>Why? How did it come to</i>
<i>this in the first place?</i>

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:25.790
<i>Why did I go to Liebe Delta?</i>

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.370
<i>That's right.</i>

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.460
<i>It started when I learned that they were</i>
<i>going to the Astronaut Training Center.</i>

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.540
<i>I was unsure what I wanted</i>
<i>to do in the future...</i>

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.160
<i>... and going to space</i>
<i>seemed like a good idea.</i>

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:43.210
<i>And I had hardly talked to either</i>
<i>of them for almost two months.</i>

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:46.180
<i>That's pretty well how it all started.</i>

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.340
<i>Aoi. What are you doing here, anyway?</i>

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:52.320
<i>What am I doing here?</i>

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:54.220
<i>I'm here because I've</i>
<i>also been selected to go.</i>

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:59.130
<i>Your Mom knows. She asked me</i>
<i>to look out for you and Yuki.</i>

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:02.230
<i>Yuki? He's going too?</i>

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.390
<i>Yes. The same Level Two.</i>

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:06.290
<i>Darn!</i>

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:12.040
<i>Though I hadn't seen Kouji in some time,</i>
<i>to some disappointment and some relief...</i>

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:17.210
<i>... and maybe some regret,</i>
<i>he hadn't changed one bit.</i>

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:20.040
<i>I had come to Liebe Delta for</i>
<i>such innocent reasons, yet!</i>

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:23.240
<i>We were suddenly involved in an accident.</i>

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:26.550
<i>Things went berserk and we had</i>
<i>no idea what was going on.</i>

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:31.790
<i>And then I learned...</i>

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:36.560
<i>... that within Liebe Delta was a
<i>hidden submersible spaceship.</i></i>

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:42.970
<i>The Ryvius.</i>

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:48.100
<i>Aboard the Ryvius, I thought</i>
<i>that help would arrive soon.</i>

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:50.110
<i>I believed it.</i>

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.940
<i>Even when we found out that suddenly we</i>
<i>were being looked upon as terrorists...</i>

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:57.010
<i>... I continued to think help would come,</i>
<i>because we did nothing wrong.</i>

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:03.250
<i>And then I became too busy with my</i>
<i>daily chores to even have time to worry.</i>

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.750
<i>And we also fought battles.</i>

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:12.660
<i>Amidst all this, perhaps I
<i>overlooked a number of things.</i></i>

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.400
<i>About Yuki.</i>

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.100
<i>About Faina.</i>

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:20.900
<i>About lkumi.</i>

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:23.000
<i>About Reiko.</i>

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:29.020
<i>And...</i>

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:31.520
<i>... l!</i>

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.230
<i>You're trying too hard.</i>

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.460
<i>Shut up.</i>

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:44.920
<i>I know that this isn't</i>
<i>gonna go on forever.</i>

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:46.630
<i>Then why continue?</i>

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.000
<i>What would you do?</i>

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:52.530
<i>Consider the present situation, everyone's</i>
<i>feelings, the remaining food stock...</i>

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:55.510
<i>... the most beneficial is</i>
<i>not the best scenario.</i>

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:56.910
<i>You're escaping from reality.</i>

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:01.840
<i>I agree. But it's no different</i>
<i>from the society we lived in.</i>

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.320
<i>There's a need to consider the</i>
<i>feelings of all kinds of people.</i>

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.950
<i>You have to turn the other</i>
<i>cheek to some things.</i>

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:08.250
<i>You sound like a cynic.</i>

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.760
<i>But unlike you, I must earn my points!</i>

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:15.260
<i>But you can use my ID to!</i>

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:18.460
<i>I don't wanna cheat! I don't want any</i>
<i>charity from someone with special status.</i>

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.100
<i>I'm working too!</i>

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.530
<i>You're doing it for Faina!</i>

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:25.190
<i>Th-That's not true! What's wrong</i>
<i>with you? This isn't like you!</i>

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.270
<i>Let me complain a little at least!</i>

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:28.940
<i>Why at me?</i>

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:30.180
<i>Because you're Kouji!</i>

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:31.540
<i>That just doesn't make sense!</i>

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.840
<i>Why have you changed so much?</i>

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:36.740
<i>I've known you since we were little kids!</i>

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:54.970
<i>Oww!</i>

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.770
<i>What do you think you're doing? Clumsy.</i>

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:59.240
<i>It was an accident! An accident!</i>

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:01.730
<i>Hey!</i>

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:04.770
<i>What's gonna happen to us?</i>

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.550
<i>Well! How should I know?</i>

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.090
<i>He's right.</i>

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:20.530
<i>How was he supposed to know that</i>
<i>something like that would happen?</i>

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.660
<i>Something like that!</i>

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:28.600
<i>No. Don't look.</i>

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:31.270
<i>K- Kozue!</i>

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:33.100
<i>I said don't look.</i>

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:37.440
<i>Kozue. How'd you get those wounds?</i>

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:40.080
<i>Don't look!</i>

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.310
<i>DON'T LOOK!</i>

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:49.220
<i>I had no idea. I had absolutely no idea.</i>

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:53.160
<i>It was enough just trying</i>
<i>to take care of myself.</i>

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:56.220
<i>You wouldn't understand. Not the way you</i>
<i>drift between the Aiba brothers, Aoi.</i>

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:57.600
<i>Me?</i>

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.470
<i>You say you want the two to get along,</i>
<i>yet you want them both to care about you.</i>

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:05.640
<i>W- Well, that's... I... I don't follow you.</i>

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.630
<i>You liar!</i>

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:08.410
<i>You're deceiving yourself!</i>

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:10.210
<i>There's no way you'd understand.</i>

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:13.480
<i>You don't believe that you have</i>
<i>what you want, yet you do!</i>

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:14.880
<i>And you've done nothing to earn it!</i>

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:18.880
<i>So there's no way you'd understand</i>
<i>how I feel! Absolutely no way!</i>

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:24.260
<i>You felt so all along?</i>

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:26.920
<i>And that's not everything. You're unfair.</i>

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.330
<i>You're unfair because you don't realize it.</i>

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:31.920
<i>But...</i>

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:35.660
<i>... both Yuki... and Kouji... to me!</i>

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:50.480
<i>I was concerned.</i>

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.650
<i>That's why!</i>

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:53.980
I'm sorry. Reiko

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:00.530
<i>What am I doing here, anyway?</i>

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.300
<i>Why am I not home?</i>

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:09.200
Hey, what a good boy.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.310
You and your peaceful expression.

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:13.000
You know, you look like a little girl!

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.810
- What are you guys doing?
- Lucson!

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:21.840
Run, Pat. I'll take care of...
Or maybe I can't take care of this.

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:23.850
Who do you think you are?

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.850
W-Well...!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.590
A hero, perhaps?

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:27.990
Ah, no, I...!

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:33.350
Ah, no! Don't! Please don't! I don't
wanna be tried for public indecency!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.700
Not again.

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:38.570
There we go.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:41.870
- We're safe now.
- No one will come here anyway.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.600
How painful, the way you said that.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.780
It's not like you to be deep in thought.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:49.470
How would you know how I feel?

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.880
You know how things are
gonna end up anyway.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:54.250
If things aren't gonna turn out well,
why get involved in the first place?

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.020
It's just troublesome. So you're
afraid of getting involved with anyone.

00:10:57.020 --> 00:11:00.220
You sense these things effortlessly,
so you know right away. Just like me.

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:02.510
You? I don't believe it.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:07.450
I'll greet people with a smile, but I
won't share my feelings with anyone.

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:10.720
You're the first person
I ever explained that to.

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:12.900
You know what that means?

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.740
I can tell that it's bothering you.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:19.300
But if you're going to get dumped anyway,
go and get dumped properly.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:21.840
- If you do that...!
- I don't know what you're talking about.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.040
I told you. I can tell what you're thinking.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.250
Where are you going?

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:30.850
So you're going, after all. You fool.

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:33.220
I'm speaking from my heart.

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:53.240
<i>What are you saying, Kouji?</i>
<i>Your logical argument is too painful!</i>

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:55.580
<i>It was my fault. Damn.</i>

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.070
<i>How many times must we repeat this?</i>

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:01.080
<i>Judging from your argument,</i>
<i>you won't be able to protect Aoi.</i>

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:05.710
<i>If you consider Aoi important,</i>
<i>guard her with your life.</i>

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:10.120
<i>What do you mean, lkumi?</i>
<i>What are you trying to say?</i>

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:16.230
Faina.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:23.700
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:27.340 --> 00:12:28.740
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:33.510
I'm sorry.
You looked so serious, so...!

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:35.950
I'm not at all upset with you.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:38.450
Guess what?

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:39.980
I made this for you, Kouji.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.680
Huh? Oh...!

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.590
- What's that?
- Huh? Well...!

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:46.830
- Aoi prepared lunch for you, right?
- Well...!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:47.730
Why?

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:52.060
Y-You see, Aoi's
team got split up...

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:54.500
...so... she's all alone now.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:58.240
So our team's looking after her.
This is like a token of her appreciation.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:00.540
You're choosing Aoi over me?

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:01.910
You're jumping to conclusions
over one lunch...!

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:03.570
Why did you save my life?

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:11.910
I heard from Ikumi that you two risked
your lives to save me on Liebe Delta.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.860
He said you gave it everything...
that you're a great guy.

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:22.330
And I felt you were getting close to me,
with your visits during my recovery...

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:24.460
...but I wasn't sure if those
were your true feelings.

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:27.130
That's why... I purposely
distanced myself from you.

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:33.330
But you continued to approach me.
You even introduced me to Aoi's team.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:36.480
Remember what you said?

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:38.070
<i>Can I ask you something?</i>

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:39.950
<i>Sure.</i>

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:42.470
<i>What do you do to forget</i>
<i>something you wanna forget?</i>

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:46.490
<i>It's impossible to forget.</i>

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.250
<i>I see.</i>

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.850
<i>"You can only part with</i>
<i>your past, on your own. "</i>

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.730
<i>Words of the Holy Mother Arne.</i>

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:57.490
<i>She's my home planet's god of Protection.</i>

00:13:58.130 --> 00:13:59.900
<i>Part with my past!</i>

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.670
<i>Everyone carries the same feeling.</i>

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:05.010
<i>You too?</i>

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:06.230
<i>Of course.</i>

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:10.170
You chose me, didn't you?
That's why I...!

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.910
Ah... W-Well...!

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.140
Why did you hold me?

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.610
I told you a number of times.

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:18.390
Many times!

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:20.680
<i>Hesitation and anxiety will</i>
<i>only weaken your determination.</i>

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:24.860
<i>But remember this.</i>

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:28.560
<i>If you keep up your defenses you</i>
<i>can hurt the feelings of others.</i>

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:32.220
<i>Because you've become my</i>
<i>boyfriend, right Kouji?</i>

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:37.470
I accepted your kindness,
so what's this act of betrayal?

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:41.440
By continuing to remain on the defensive,
you've been hurting me all along.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.910
- I've been hurting you?
- Yes, I'm hurt!

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:49.550
I-I have trouble understanding you.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.150
You're too decisive about everything.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:55.550
Even when we were labeled terrorists...

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:58.380
...and even when Blue and the others
were forced off the bridge.

00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:00.190
<i>The mercy of Holy Mother Arne.</i>

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.990
<i>You have taken a step toward</i>
<i>freedom, as you wished.</i>

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:09.170
<i>For you were able to sever the ties you</i>
<i>had with the society you hate so much.</i>

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:12.330
<i>Otherwise, this reform</i>
<i>wouldn't have happened.</i>

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:16.600
<i>We must part with our past in</i>
<i>order to move forward, Kouji.</i>

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.910
We sense things differently.

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:22.710
I tried to do as you said,
but I can't get myself to do so.

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:24.180
Well, do it!

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:24.850
I'm saying...!

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:26.910
If you've accepted me as
part of you, then do it!

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:30.220
You can do it. I believe in you.

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:34.820
- I can't.
- Kouji!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.750
What are you doing here?

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:53.980
Yuki, long time no see.

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:56.020
What are you acting so casually for?

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:58.090
A girl should not be wandering
out here on her own!

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:01.380
There you go again. Couldn't you
talk to me a little more kindly?

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.380
Don't go out on your own.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:07.260
Wait.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:10.020
I agree that the public
morale on board is at a low.

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:12.570
There are also things going on
that we are completely unaware of.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.070
Too many things!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:15.870
But I don't want to control
people with the use of force!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:20.340
Also, I think our present focus should be
on how to elude attacks from the enemy.

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.910
So that there are no more victims.

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:25.240
That's easy.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:27.410
We'll dive in.

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:31.490
Deep enough that not even the same
model ships as the Ryvius can chase us.

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:34.420
In the meantime, I want you to
think about what's going on board.

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:36.460
If you can't do that...!

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:38.580
No, nothing.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.370
Why we fought?

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:47.560
Right. The one, three years ago.

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:52.070
Why did you fight Kouji? Tell me.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.870
Because he was being a pest.

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:59.710
"Do this, do that, this would be
better, you'd better do that..."

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:02.610
He'd tie people down with
what he believes is right.

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:06.180
Even though all he does himself is
cling onto others, like a parasite.

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:10.290
However.

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:12.830
Once I gave him a good beating,
he wouldn't even come to talk to me.

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:15.330
- He's quick to run away.
- But he's your brother.

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:18.300
How much longer must I be
connected with that guy!

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:21.800
<i>So you two are seeing each other?</i>

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:25.470
<i>If so, why didn't you tell me?</i>
<i>I feel like such a fool.</i>

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:30.840
Damn him. How could he
put on such a foolish laugh?

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.740
He cannot protect you.

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:37.650
Aoi! Come with me!

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:39.890
- But I...!
- Come!

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:40.820
- But.
- Come!

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:42.420
What are you doing?

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:43.980
- Yuki.
- Kouji.

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:50.250
It's been ages since the three
of us were together like this.

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:53.090
- Hey, I'll make lunch for us...!
- <i>You're unfair.</i>

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:57.740
- Why can't you take care of her properly?
- I am.

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:59.570
- No you're not.
- I am.

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:00.900
You don't have any idea!

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:03.340
Cut it out! Don't fight!

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:05.970
Yuki, why can't you try
and get along with Kouji?

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:08.540
- It's odd, isn't it?
- Never mind. It's all right, Aoi.

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.150
Answer me, Yuki!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:11.850
- Forget it!
- Yuki!

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:14.490
Yuki! YUKI!

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:17.860
Why is it? Damn it!

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:19.850
They haven't a clue
about what goes on here.

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:24.330
Why does everybody fight?

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:28.700
Because they're human. As much as
I hate to think of it that way.

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:30.970
Everyone's being such fools.

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:33.530
With no adults around, there's
no one to put a stop to things.

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:38.400
If people bothered to look ahead a little,
it should be obvious what would happen.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.980
It was the same with me.

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:46.080
Everyone's escaping. So am I.

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:53.390
That's funny.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:57.860
Someone needs to put a stop to things.

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:00.430
When I look back...

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:03.530
...I feel things were most stable while
Airs Blue had control of things.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:06.240
There may have been discontent
on an individual level...

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:07.430
...but things were still stable.

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:11.200
Things were certainly stable.

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.880
We're diving?

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.380
But we're in Sere 4.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:18.350
We'll dive further to elude the enemy.

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:22.520
Our records show that Vital
Guarder was active past Sere 5.

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:24.420
I understand what you're saying, but...!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.890
So we're testing our limits?

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.260
This could be a trial never
undertaken by humankind.

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:30.320
But no matter what we do,
no one will be watching.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.630
I'll create a Solid.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:34.830
Why are you so happy, Kreis?

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.320
Are you sure?

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.040
<i>I am sure.</i>

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.510
<i>I'll show them.</i>

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:13.940
<i>In my own way,</i>
<i>the way that suits me best.</i>

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:18.870
<i>I'll show him that I am correct.</i>

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:21.840
Kouji! Are you trying
to put me into your past?

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:26.990
I cannot give up my past.
I must face my past.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:30.720
That is what I, who tried to escape
to Liebe Delta, must do now.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.150
I must...!

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.170
Why?

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:46.600
I thought you were the one.
But you weren't.

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:50.000
I'm sorry I gave you hope.
I can no longer be with you...!

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:54.250
- Sorry, Faina.
- Not to worry.

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:56.110
I'll be sure to awaken you.

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:59.210
Even if I must completely
cut off your past to do so.

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:01.020
- What's going on?
- Hey.

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:02.820
- The Lift ship is separating on its own.
- What?

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:05.650
- I'm switching to our backup power.
- Without our approach?

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:08.900
An enemy?

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:11.670
<i>I call for the attention of</i>
<i>everyone aboard the Ryvius!</i>

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:16.400
<i>I am pilot of Vital Guarder,</i>
<i>Level Two Navigator E328455, Ikumi Oze!</i>

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:20.870
<i>I have taken over the Vital Guarder.</i>

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:24.240
<i>The tremor you felt was a result of</i>
<i>the Vital Guarder grasping the Ryvius.</i>

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:27.610
<i>I warn everyone on the Ryvius.</i>

00:21:27.610 --> 00:21:31.120
<i>I hereby prohibit any and all</i>
<i>acts of violence aboard the ship.</i>

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:35.560
<i>If anyone is caught breaking this rule,</i>
<i>I will resort to force with the Vital Guarder!</i>

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:36.540
<i>I'm serious!</i>

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:42.050
- How could he?
- Ikumi.

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:45.500
<i>Do not make a mistake.</i>
<i>Do not cause trouble.</i>

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:48.700
<i>Do not fight. Do not blame others.</i>
<i>Do not hurt others. Remain normal!</i>

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.500
- He's gonna kill me.
- <i>I don't wish to hurt anyone.</i>

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:53.440
- That person's gonna kill me!
- <i>But, if anyone hurts another... I'll!</i>

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:54.270
<i>I'll!</i>

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:55.180
<i>I'll!</i>

00:21:55.180 --> 00:21:57.080
- Why aren't you here with me?
- <i>I WILL!</i>

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:58.810
You're contradicting yourself.

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:01.270
Hey, what's gotten into you, Ikumi?

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:04.480
IKUMI!

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:11.910
In your dry eyes...

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:16.980
...a silhouette appears

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:21.690
The blue colored future...

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:28.420
...swayed and glittered

00:22:29.600 --> 00:22:37.840
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:37.840 --> 00:22:46.450
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:54.890
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:58.790
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:05.160
goodbye

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:10.920
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:10.920 --> 00:23:12.390
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: We Don't Need Tomorrow

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:12.760
Next episode: We Don't Need Tomorrow

00:23:12.760 --> 00:23:16.230
Next episode: We Don't Need Tomorrow
After getting onto Vital Guarder, Ikumi
demanded order from those on the Ryvius.

00:23:16.230 --> 00:23:17.600
Next episode: We Don't Need Tomorrow

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:20.800
Next episode: We Don't Need Tomorrow
As the situation was headed
toward destruction, I realized...!

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:21.600
Next episode: We Don't Need Tomorrow

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:24.170
Next episode: We Don't Need Tomorrow
Yes, I happened to realize something.

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:25.070
Next episode: We Don't Need Tomorrow

00:23:25.070 --> 00:23:26.710
Next episode: We Don't Want Tomorrow
And that's why I can say this.

00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:29.330
Next episode: We Don't Need Tomorrow
Let me say it. We don't need tomorrow.
